sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Browser
  participant App
  participant IdP as Identity Provider
  User->>Browser: click sign in
  Browser->>App: GET /login
  App-->>Browser: redirect to IdP
  Browser->>IdP: authorize
  IdP-->>Browser: code
  Browser->>App: callback code
  App->>IdP: exchange code
  IdP-->>App: tokens
  App-->>Browser: session cookie
  Note over Browser,App: session established
